# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use gates and readout instructions on IBM QPUs that are calibrated differently from the default set, such as slow gates and shorter measurements"
msgstr "Gunakan gate dan instruksi readout pada QPU IBM yang dikalibrasi secara berbeda dari set default, seperti gate lambat dan pengukuran yang lebih singkat"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions"
msgstr "Instruksi dengan kalibrasi khusus"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions {#specially-calibrated-instructions}"
msgstr "Instruksi dengan kalibrasi khusus {#specially-calibrated-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "By default, the quantum gates and readout operations on IBM&reg; quantum computers are calibrated for optimal performance across general use cases. Some workloads, however, benefit from instructions whose parameters are tuned differently. For example, [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) (`measure_2`) is a readout operation tailored for measurements in the middle of a circuit, and slower `cz` gates can improve the results of some error mitigation workflows.\n"
msgstr "Secara default, gate kuantum dan operasi readout pada komputer kuantum IBM&reg; dikalibrasi untuk performa optimal di berbagai kasus penggunaan umum. Namun, beberapa beban kerja diuntungkan oleh instruksi dengan parameter yang disetel secara berbeda. Misalnya, [`MidCircuitMeasure`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) (`measure_2`) adalah operasi readout yang dirancang untuk pengukuran di tengah circuit, dan gate `cz` yang lebih lambat dapat meningkatkan hasil dari beberapa alur kerja mitigasi error.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Specially calibrated instructions come in two forms, and you access them differently:\n"
msgstr "Instruksi dengan kalibrasi khusus hadir dalam dua bentuk, dan cara mengaksesnya berbeda:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Instructions with different signatures**](#different) are calibrated alongside the standard instructions in the default calibration, so you add them to your circuits like any other instruction. They are usually identified by a suffix, such as `measure_2`.\n"
msgstr "[**Instruksi dengan signature berbeda**](#different) dikalibrasi bersama instruksi standar dalam kalibrasi default, jadi kamu menambahkannya ke circuit seperti instruksi lainnya. Biasanya instruksi ini ditandai dengan sufiks, seperti `measure_2`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[**Alternative calibrations**](#alternative-calibrations) replace parts of the default calibration with differently tuned parameters. You select one by passing a `calibration_id` when you retrieve the backend.\n"
msgstr "[**Kalibrasi alternatif**](#alternative-calibrations) menggantikan sebagian kalibrasi default dengan parameter yang disetel secara berbeda. Kamu memilihnya dengan memberikan `calibration_id` saat mengambil backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To learn how IBM quantum computers are calibrated, see [Monitor, calibrate, and benchmark](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
msgstr "Untuk mempelajari cara komputer kuantum IBM dikalibrasi, lihat [Pantau, kalibrasi, dan benchmark](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"different\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instructions with different signatures {#instructions-with-different-signatures}"
msgstr "Instruksi dengan signature berbeda {#instructions-with-different-signatures}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "These instructions are calibrated with the standard instruction set, so you don't need to do anything special to retrieve a backend that supports them. To use one, add the corresponding `qiskit-ibm-runtime` instruction to your circuit.\n"
msgstr "Instruksi ini dikalibrasi bersama set instruksi standar, jadi kamu tidak perlu melakukan hal khusus untuk mengambil backend yang mendukungnya. Untuk menggunakannya, tambahkan instruksi `qiskit-ibm-runtime` yang sesuai ke circuit kamu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-27
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Instruction | Description | Typical use case | Use in Qiskit | Processor family |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `measure_2` | Shorter measurement pulse | [Mid-circuit measurements](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) | [`MidCircuitMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-measure) (v0.43.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `reset_2` | Shorter conditional reset pulse that uses `measure_2` | Mid-circuit qubit reset | [`MidCircuitReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-reset) (v0.49.0 or later) | Heron |\n"
"| `measure_reset` | Measurement like `measure` that also resets the qubit* | Measure and reset a qubit | [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) (v0.50.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `measure_reset_2` | Shorter measurement like `measure_2` that also resets the qubit* | Measure and reset a qubit mid-circuit | Initialize [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) with `name=\"measure_reset_2\"` (v0.50.0 or later) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `xslow` | Bit-flip (X) gate with an extended duration | [Postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) and error mitigation. It is the default value of the `x_pulse_type` option in [postselection passes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-mitigation/postselection-passes) | [`XSlowGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-x-slow-gate#xslowgate) (v0.50.0 or later) | All |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Instruksi | Deskripsi | Kasus penggunaan umum | Penggunaan di Qiskit | Keluarga prosesor |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| `measure_2` | Pulsa pengukuran yang lebih singkat | [Pengukuran mid-circuit](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuitmeasure-method) | [`MidCircuitMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-measure) (v0.43.0 atau lebih baru) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `reset_2` | Pulsa reset kondisional yang lebih singkat yang menggunakan `measure_2` | Reset qubit mid-circuit | [`MidCircuitReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-mid-circuit-reset) (v0.49.0 atau lebih baru) | Heron |\n"
"| `measure_reset` | Pengukuran seperti `measure` yang juga me-reset qubit* | Mengukur dan me-reset qubit | [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) (v0.50.0 atau lebih baru) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `measure_reset_2` | Pengukuran yang lebih singkat seperti `measure_2` yang juga me-reset qubit* | Mengukur dan me-reset qubit di tengah circuit | Inisialisasi [`MeasureReset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-measure-reset) dengan `name=\"measure_reset_2\"` (v0.50.0 atau lebih baru) | Heron, Nighthawk r2 |\n"
"| `xslow` | Gate bit-flip (X) dengan durasi yang diperpanjang | [Postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) dan mitigasi error. Ini adalah nilai default opsi `x_pulse_type` di [postselection pass](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-mitigation/postselection-passes) | [`XSlowGate`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/circuit-library-x-slow-gate#xslowgate) (v0.50.0 atau lebih baru) | Semua |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "\\* On Heron processors, the reset is conditional on the measurement result. On Nighthawk r2 processors, the reset is unconditional.\n"
msgstr "\\* Pada prosesor Heron, reset bersifat kondisional terhadap hasil pengukuran. Pada prosesor Nighthawk r2, reset bersifat tanpa syarat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because these instructions are not supported on every backend, check the backend's supported instructions before you use them:\n"
msgstr "Karena instruksi ini tidak didukung di setiap backend, periksa instruksi yang didukung backend sebelum menggunakannya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To find all backends that support an instruction, use:\n"
msgstr "Untuk menemukan semua backend yang mendukung suatu instruksi, gunakan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use `instruction_signatures` to see the signatures of these specially calibrated instructions:\n"
msgstr "Gunakan `instruction_signatures` untuk melihat signature dari instruksi dengan kalibrasi khusus ini:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternative calibrations {#alternative-calibrations}"
msgstr "Kalibrasi alternatif {#alternative-calibrations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternative calibrations replace parts of the default calibration with differently tuned parameters. Each alternative calibration has a calibration ID, and its availability depends on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Kalibrasi alternatif menggantikan sebagian kalibrasi default dengan parameter yang disetel secara berbeda. Setiap kalibrasi alternatif memiliki ID kalibrasi, dan ketersediaannya bergantung pada QPU.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use an alternative calibration, pass its `calibration_id` when you retrieve the backend. The backend's target, and therefore the transpiler, uses the instruction properties from that calibration, and primitive jobs that you run on the backend execute with it.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggunakan kalibrasi alternatif, berikan `calibration_id`-nya saat mengambil backend. Target backend, dan karenanya transpiler, memakai properti instruksi dari kalibrasi tersebut, dan job primitive yang kamu jalankan di backend dieksekusi dengan kalibrasi itu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Alternative calibrations are not available on all QPUs.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Kalibrasi alternatif tidak tersedia di semua QPU.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow gate calibrations {#slow-gate-calibrations}"
msgstr "Kalibrasi gate lambat {#slow-gate-calibrations}"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Slow gate calibrations tune the `cz` gate to be slower than in the default calibration. Slower `cz` gates might improve performance for large-scale observable estimation workflows with error mitigation, but they also increase the total duration of your circuit, which causes some additional decoherence.\n"
msgstr "Kalibrasi gate lambat menyetel gate `cz` agar lebih lambat daripada kalibrasi default. Gate `cz` yang lebih lambat dapat meningkatkan performa untuk alur kerja estimasi observable skala besar dengan mitigasi error, tetapi juga menambah total durasi circuit kamu, yang menyebabkan sedikit dekoherensi tambahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On Heron processors, slow gate calibrations are also available with two modes of two-level system (TLS) bias control:\n"
msgstr "Pada prosesor Heron, kalibrasi gate lambat juga tersedia dengan dua mode kontrol bias two-level system (TLS):\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**DC TLS bias** is optimized for the best instantaneous performance. The default calibration uses DC TLS bias.\n"
msgstr "**DC TLS bias** dioptimalkan untuk performa sesaat terbaik. Kalibrasi default menggunakan DC TLS bias.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**AC TLS bias** modulates the TLS bias to stabilize device errors over time, which keeps the device's noise model stable during lengthy workflows. See \"Noise stabilization\" in [Observable Estimation in the Absence of Classical Verification](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.25998#page=52) for details.\n"
msgstr "**AC TLS bias** memodulasi bias TLS untuk menstabilkan error perangkat dari waktu ke waktu, sehingga model noise perangkat tetap stabil selama alur kerja yang panjang. Lihat \"Noise stabilization\" di [Observable Estimation in the Absence of Classical Verification](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.25998#page=52) untuk detailnya.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Nighthawk processors do not use TLS bias, so they have a single slow gate calibration.\n"
msgstr "Prosesor Nighthawk tidak menggunakan bias TLS, jadi hanya memiliki satu kalibrasi gate lambat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Calibration ID | Processor family | TLS bias | Recommended for |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| None (default calibration) | All | DC (Heron) | General use. Especially recommended for workloads whose bitstrings can be classically distilled, such as peaked circuits and [SQD or SKQD](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/sqd-skqd) workflows, and for workloads with [error detection](/tutorials/spacetime-codes). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_dc` | Heron | DC | Large-scale observable estimation workflows, especially those that use heuristic error mitigation such as zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_ac` | Heron | AC | Workflows that require stable error rates over long sessions. Strongly recommended for workflows that involve noise learning, such as probabilistic error amplification (PEA) and probabilistic error cancellation (PEC). |\n"
"| `slow_gates` | Nighthawk | Not applicable | Observable estimation workflows that use error mitigation, such as ZNE, PEA, and PEC. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| ID kalibrasi | Keluarga prosesor | Bias TLS | Direkomendasikan untuk |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n"
"| None (kalibrasi default) | Semua | DC (Heron) | Penggunaan umum. Terutama direkomendasikan untuk beban kerja yang bitstring-nya dapat didistilasi secara klasik, seperti circuit berpuncak (peaked) dan alur kerja [SQD atau SKQD](/learning/courses/integrating-quantum-and-high-performance-computing/sqd-skqd), serta untuk beban kerja dengan [deteksi error](/tutorials/spacetime-codes). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_dc` | Heron | DC | Alur kerja estimasi observable skala besar, terutama yang menggunakan mitigasi error heuristik seperti zero-noise extrapolation (ZNE). |\n"
"| `slow_gates_ac` | Heron | AC | Alur kerja yang membutuhkan tingkat error stabil selama session yang panjang. Sangat direkomendasikan untuk alur kerja yang melibatkan noise learning, seperti probabilistic error amplification (PEA) dan probabilistic error cancellation (PEC). |\n"
"| `slow_gates` | Nighthawk | Tidak berlaku | Alur kerja estimasi observable yang menggunakan mitigasi error, seperti ZNE, PEA, dan PEC. |\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example:\n"
msgstr "Contohnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"When you use `slow_gates_ac`, submit all jobs in the workflow to a single [session](/guides/run-jobs-session) so that they run while the device's noise remains stable.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Saat kamu menggunakan `slow_gates_ac`, kirim semua job dalam alur kerja ke satu [session](/guides/run-jobs-session) agar job berjalan selama noise perangkat tetap stabil.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Check gate durations {#check-gate-durations}"
msgstr "Periksa durasi gate {#check-gate-durations}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because slow gate calibrations increase `cz` gate durations, compare the durations against the default calibration to understand the effect on your circuit. Use the backend's target to find the duration, in seconds, of the `cz` gate on a specific pair of qubits:\n"
msgstr "Karena kalibrasi gate lambat menambah durasi gate `cz`, bandingkan durasinya dengan kalibrasi default untuk memahami efeknya pada circuit kamu. Gunakan target backend untuk mengetahui durasi, dalam detik, gate `cz` pada pasangan qubit tertentu:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the target reflects the selected calibration, transpile your circuits against the backend that uses the same `calibration_id` you plan to run on.\n"
msgstr "Karena target mencerminkan kalibrasi yang dipilih, transpile circuit kamu terhadap backend yang menggunakan `calibration_id` yang sama dengan yang akan kamu jalankan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya {#next-steps}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-22
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- Learn how to [execute dynamic circuits](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits) with mid-circuit measurements.\n"
"- Use [postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) to filter out results affected by correlated noise.\n"
"- Read about how IBM quantum computers are [monitored, calibrated, and benchmarked](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Pelajari cara [mengeksekusi circuit dinamis](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits) dengan pengukuran mid-circuit.\n"
"- Gunakan [postselection](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/addons/qiskit-mitigation/guides/postselection-with-non-markovian-error-checks) untuk menyaring hasil yang terpengaruh noise berkorelasi.\n"
"- Baca tentang bagaimana komputer kuantum IBM [dipantau, dikalibrasi, dan di-benchmark](/guides/calibration-jobs).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
